    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏpertōrĭum</span></b> ,
			ii, n.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., <i>a cover</i> (post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				87, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Exod. 36, 19</span></i>.—<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">peccati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. in Psa. 118</span></i>
			, Serm. 7, § 31; <i><span class="en">id. Cant.
				Cantic. 3, § 2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>A garment</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Psa.
				101, 27</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>A grave</i> (post-class.),
				<i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 3, 12</span></i>.</div>
